        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luek Go̱kä ni Yeɣu kɛ Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär Juda ni Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat kään kä cuɛ luny dhɔrɛ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gök ni Yeɣu gat Ɣä-na-ni jɛ wä lor, kä cuɛ kuäär ni Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat jiök i̱, “Aderi ku luäk ni nɛy tin dual, kä bi nhɔk ni nɛy tin lökɛ Kuoth Nhial? Kɛ kui̱c kä nɛmɛ, gak Kuoth Nhial kɛ ji̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku duundɛ la ɣöö ca tha̱a̱ŋ kä ti gɔw jëk kä ji̱, ci kuth Ä-ce-roth däk muun. Kä ci lɔcdu ka̱m Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Riali Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat kɛ rɔ ikä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn kuäär ni Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat ciɛŋɛ ni Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, cuɛ lɛ wä ja̱l rɛy nath a känɛ nikä Ber-cɛ-ba a wä ni wi̱i̱ päämni Ɛ-pa-rim, kɛ ɣöö bɛ naath luɔ̱c kä Kuoth Nhial, Kuoth gua̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruëëc kuany rɛy wec kɛɛliw kä wi̱i̱ Juda diaal tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m, wec kɛ wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruëëc jiök i̱, “Ŋa̱cɛ min bia la̱t ɛgɔaa, kɛ ɣöö /cia lät ni raan ikä, lät yɛn ni Kuoth Nhial ikä. Kä jɛn bɛ te kɛɛl kɛ yɛ mi ŋok yɛn luk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ kua Kuoth Nhial luɔ̱th. Kä tiɛtdɛ mɔ bia la̱t ɔ, kɛ ɣöö kɛ Kuoth Nhial Kuothdan /cɛ mi cia̱ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ nhɔk, kä cɛ liak nhɔk kiɛ kök.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat ruëëc kuany bä kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, ji̱ Lii-bay kɛ bööth palä kɛ bööth thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kɛ ɣöö bikɛ ram mi ci ŋut Kuɔth Nhial to̱l lat kɛnɛ kam nɛɛni ti ci gua̱c kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ ka̱m ŋuɔ̱t ti̱ti̱, “Yɛn la̱tdɛ kɛ lɔcdun kɛɛliw kɛ ŋa̱th rɛy luthä Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wee tekɛ luk mi ca nöŋ ji̱ ɛ raan kä gaatmuɔɔr tin cieŋ wi̱i̱nikiɛn, ɛ ram mi ci raan näk kiɛ ram mi ci ŋuɔ̱t töl kiɛ luëëk, bikɛ luek, akɛ ca Kuoth Nhial lät kä dueer. Kɛ ɣöö /ci kɛ̈cdɛ bi ben kä ji̱ yɛnɛ gaatmuɔɔr. Kä mi wi̱i̱ nɛmɛ wä la̱t, ci bi tekɛ duer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ bo̱o̱th palä min di̱t ni Ä-mɛ̈r-yaa bɛ yɛ böth kä ti diaal tin luɔtkɛ ni Kuoth Nhial. Kä bi Dhɛ-bɛ̈d-yaa gat I-ca-mel bo̱o̱th thuɔk duëël Juda, bɛ yɛ böth kä tin diaal tin luɔtkɛ ni kuäär. Kä bi ji̱ Lii-bay lät nhiamdun ala bööth. La̱tdɛ agɔaa kä bi Kuɔth Nhial te kɛɛl kɛ nɛy tɔ̱ la̱tkɛ cuŋ tɔ̱!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
